WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.160
There!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.070
There! And there!

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:12.820
Well?!

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:17.410
Over here, over here.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.160
I said, over here.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.880
Are your large eyes just for show?

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.240
Come at me as if I were your mother's killer!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.840
<i>Mom's killer!</i>

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.080
Who told you to stab a tree?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.390
Here.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.820
You'll never be able to avenge
your mother at this rate.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.090
<i>After her mother was run over by
a blonde noblewoman's carriage...</i>

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>...Rosalie, a poor girl from the slums of Paris, was orphaned.</i>

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.280
<i>A merciful Oscar had taken her in,</i>

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:09.680
<i>and she now resides at the Jarjayes manor,
where she is training hard in swordsmanship.</i>

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:12.930
Come on, block it!

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.660
There!

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:14.890
Right, left, shoulder!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.180
Your stance is still open to attacks!

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.060
Come on, you'll be skewered!

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:21.920
Watch out!

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:25.470
Pull it together.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:27.770
I said I'd teach you how to use a sword,

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.760
but I never said anything about
teaching you how to swim.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.000
Here.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.940
Are you all right, Rosalie?

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.050
It's so frustrating!

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:43.040
You just enjoy making a fool out of me everyday!

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:46.080
You're making a mockery of my earnest feelings!

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.190
You'll catch a cold if you stay wet.

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.590
You should change your clothes.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:00.000
You misunderstand me.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.510
Why would I make a fool out of you?

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.270
Lady Oscar...

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.130
I'm sorry.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.310
I...

