00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:53.420
episode

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:53.420
"Mother,

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:53.420
Her Name is...?"

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:15.150
Do you really think you'll be able to find
the woman who killed Rosalie's mother?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.610
To be honest, I'm not that certain.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.460
Rosalie is desperate.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.580
If you don't find her, she'll be devastated.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.500
I know.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.530
André, I need to ask you for a favor.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.990
Me?

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.460
I want you to devote the next
week to Rosalie, starting today.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.390
<i>Is she not here?</i>

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.420
Please excuse me.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.690
It smells like Lady Oscar...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.860
How could a person like her...

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.720
<i>How could a person like her exist in this world?</i>

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.870
<i>And to be allowed to be by Lady Oscar's side...!</i>

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.310
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:41.730
<i>But I have to avenge my mother.</i>

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:46.280
<i>That's why Lady Oscar pitied me.</i>

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.110
<i>Yet, I...</i>

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.120
<i>I feel strange.</i>

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.380
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.270
<i>Why, Lady Oscar?</i>

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:16.650
Why were you born a woman?

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.880
Lady Oscar...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.690
What are you doing in my room?

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:24.290
Please excuse me.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:24.950
Wait!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.230
I'm sorry.

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:36.290
Your nanny had asked me to
bring your shirt to your room.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.800
U-Um, please excuse me.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.080
Hold on.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.800
Madame Elizabeth is having a ball
at her manor early next week.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.440
I'm taking you with me.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.680
I-I don't know a thing about dancing!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.550
Plus, I don't have a clue on how to act proper...

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.110
Not ''proper'', but ''properly''.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.350
Yes...

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:05.430
Listen, I'll introduce you as a distant
relative of my elder sister's husband.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.760
But...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:09.270
Starting today, you'll learn how to
dance and carry a conversation.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:11.500
André will be your partner.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:17.070
Almost all the prominent ladies of
the court are invited to this ball.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:22.310
<i>A ball where all the prominent
ladies of the court will gather...</i>

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.250
<i>That's right!</i>

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.750
<i>Perhaps that woman will be there, too!</i>

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.690
<i>How could I ever forget her face!</i>

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.220
Are you coming?

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.080
Yes!

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.110
C-Captain of the Royal Guards Regiment?!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:42.560
Yes.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:44.850
Q-Quit joking.

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:46.520
How is that even possible with my rank?

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.760
It's true.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.740
Cardinal Rohan said he would arrange it for you.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:55.630
Wh-Why would Cardinal Rohan,
who is despised by Queen Antoinette,

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.700
do something like that for me?

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.640
I told Cardinal Rohan that you're a Count.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.040
A... A Count?!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.710
Yes.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.670
Listen,

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.540
you're Count Nicolas de la Motte.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:13.650
And I'm Countess Jeanne Valois de la Motte.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.380
B-But that's...!

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:18.350
We can't just go ahead and call ourselves
Count and Countess without paying taxes!

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.600
Imagine what would happen if the
military police find out about us!

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:23.850
True, staying here would be dangerous.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.070
Th-Then, what do you suggest we do?!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.970
I borrowed money and rented a large manor
in Nouveau Saint Germain.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.460
We'll move there immediately.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.730
Jeanne, you never cease to amaze me...

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.920
A noblewoman named Madame Elizabeth is
having a ball at her manor next week.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.650
As long as you have a manor...

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.190
...and are wearing a genuine uniform
of the Royal Guards Regiment,

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.650
we'll be able to put on an interesting show.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:02.920
Presenting Lady Oscar François de Jarjayes!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.900
Lady Oscar?! ls it true?!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.570
The same Lady Oscar who is known
for her distaste in balls?!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.340
My, I wonder what brings her to Madame Elizabeth's ball all of a sudden?

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.950
This can't be! This must be a dream!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.790
This can't be happening!

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.490
I wonder who that young lady is?

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:31.150
I've never seen her before.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.860
Look, they're going crazy just seeing
you escort a woman by the hand.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.860
If they see you dance with her,
they'll all start convulsing.

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.770
I'll leave the dancing to you.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.170
Good evening, Oscar.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.340
Madame Elizabeth, good evening.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:51.770
May I ask who this angelic
and charming young lady is?

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.980
She's Rosalie La Lamorlière{Moliàre}.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:57.380
She's a distant relative of
my elder sister's husband.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.190
Come, Rosalie.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.210
Introduce yourself.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.460
Lady Oscar took that girl's hand again!

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:04.540
No, no! Kill me now!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.260
Stop it! Lady Oscar belongs to all of us!

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.630
She can't have Lady Oscar all to herself!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.030
I'm Rosalie.

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:13.000
Pleased to meet you.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:16.330
Please have a wonderful
evening and enjoy yourself.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:23.340
<i>Am I going to be able to leave
here in one piece tonight?</i>

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>I didn't realize Lady Oscar was so popular.</i>

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.580
<i>How magnificent!</i>

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.920
<i>She's wearing such a dazzling dress!</i>

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.360
<i>I wonder who she is?</i>

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.320
<i>Could she also be Lady Oscar's admirer...?</i>

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.360
Oh...

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.160
Lady Charlotte is in attendance tonight, as well.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.180
Charlotte?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.130
<i>The daughter of a Count...</i>

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:53.470
<i>Unlike me, she's a true lady of the nobility.</i>

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.780
Well then, Lady Rosalie.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.300
May I have this dance?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.740
You seem to be taken by Lady Charlotte.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:30.680
Her mother, Madame Polignac has a cold
and stayed home, so she came by herself.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:33.170
Who's Madame Polignac?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.120
She's Queen Antoinette's favorite Lady.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:41.220
Well, I guess you could say she's the most powerful woman in Versailles after the Queen.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:45.760
My... André, you sound as though
you don't like Madame Polignac.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.620
Perhaps.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:50.940
But Lady Charlotte is wonderfully lovely, isn't she?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.300
M-Madame!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:57.190
A lady has collapsed in the antechamber!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.900
Come, everyone. Please continue your dance.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.520
I'm sure it's nothing serious.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.500
Please excuse me.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.140
Is she all right?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.610
I-I'm Nicolas de la Motte,
Captain of the Royal Guards Regiment.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.100
My wife is, well...

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:40.710
Due to years of malnutrition,
she's grown very weak, as you can see...

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:44.010
With my meager salary, it's just... well...

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.850
Poor Jeanne!

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:48.840
Forgive me!

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.340
It's all because I'm a good for nothing husband!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.290
Poor thing...

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.500
You mustn't feel so discouraged.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.630
I will arrange a carriage to take your wife home.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:05.720
Also, it won't be much,
but I'll send some money later.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.470
Such merciful words!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.970
Thank you very much!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:15.480
I, Captain Nicolas de la Motte,
will never forget that I am in your debt!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.550
Captain la Motte, please don't worry.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:23.440
I'll personally ask Her Majesty to raise your salary.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.490
Thank you again for everything!

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.930
<i>Nicolas' acting is quite impressive.</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.170
<i>Noblewomen are all naïve.</i>

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.230
<i>Tricking them is a piece of cake.</i>

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.370
Pleased to meet you.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:47.680
We were all just
talking about you.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.650
Say, is it true you're
staying with Lady Oscar?

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:52.600
Yes.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.150
How envious.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:57.550
Say, does Lady Oscar spend
all her time with you?

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.290
Does she dine
with you, as well?

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.630
How would you describe
Lady Oscar's hand?

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:05.060
Please be our friend,
Lady Rosalie.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.930
Except for Her Majesty,
she has never escorted...

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.490
<i>The lady who killed my mother isn't here.</i>

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.620
<i>Where is Mom's killer...?</i>

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.810
Well now. Look at how popular
Rosalie is with everyone already.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:18.740
Yeah.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.050
She said she's an orphan who
was born in the slums of Paris,

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.510
but she's a fascinating girl.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.820
She's timid, but when I look at her from here,

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:29.620
she sometimes has such a dignified
expression, it takes you by surprise.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.520
Yeah.

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:33.520
No one would ever doubt that she's nobility.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.550
Ladies!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.730
How long do you intend on making a fuss?

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:39.790
Lady Charlotte...

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.200
The next song is a minuet.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.240
Lady Rosalie, aren't you going to dance?

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.200
Um, a minuet...?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.810
My! You don't even know what a minuet is?!

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:54.110
Unbelievable!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:15:00.120
Lady Rosalie, it's best you don't let
all this attention get to your head.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:05.820
Everyone is just curious about your timid,
countrified manners and Lady Oscar.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.290
Come, let's go.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.460
My, the nerve!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:14.850
We all know she's infatuated with
Lady Oscar more than any of us!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.030
Lady Rosalie, don't let it bother you.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.170
By the way, what kind of lady is your mother?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.440
Um, my Mom...?

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:23.990
<i>''Mom''...?</i>

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:25.770
You call her ''Mom''?!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.950
What a vulgar way form of address!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.020
I'll be sure to let my mother know!

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:38.370
That Lady Oscar brought such
a base girl to a ball for nobles!

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:49.260
Are you really a distant relative of Lady Oscar?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.740
Now, Lady Rosalie, answer me!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.860
H-How dare you!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.860
I am the daughter of a noble!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:13.320
I am the daughter of a noble!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.460
My mother's name is...!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:15.690
My mother's name is...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.930
<i>I'm a noble...</i>

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.400
<i>Martine Gabrielle...</i>

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.700
<i>Martine Gabrielle...</i>

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:35.340
<i>Your mother's name is Martine Gabrielle...</i>

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.550
<i>Mom!</i>

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.880
<i>Who's Martine Gabrielle?!</i>

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.810
<i>Tell me, Mom!</i>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.650
<i>Whose child am l?!</i>

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.850
<i>Where do I have to go to see her, Mom?!</i>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.840
<i>Tell me!</i>

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:03.830
Rosalie!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:06.610
André.

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.320
We pulled it off!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.420
Well, Nicolas? Wasn't it a piece of cake?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.350
That aside, you sure are a cunning woman!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.860
Our next goal, Nicolas...

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:21.590
What is it?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:25.140
We're going to approach the Queen at the Palace!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.200
I'm sor-

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.710
Y-You're...!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.120
Jeanne!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.140
Hey, what's wrong?

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:51.320
It's nothing, Nicolas.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.460
She just looked like someone
I knew, but it's not her.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.020
Come, let's go.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.220
Jeanne!

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:02.730
I believe you're mistaking me for someone else.

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:04.850
I've never seen you before.

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:09.900
What are you doing?

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:11.730
Listen, Jeanne.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.080
Mom is dead.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:16.610
She was run over by a noble's carriage.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.490
<i>Jeanne, how can you look
at me with such cold eyes?</i>

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.920
<i>Is the sister I knew really dead?</i>

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:33.860
Nicolas, hurry up!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:34.490
Yeah...

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.460
Rosalie, are you all right?

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.140
That noble girl... I feel like I've
seen her somewhere before...

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.170
Shut up!

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:45.350
Do you really think we'd know
someone in a place like this?!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.710
<i>Jeanne...</i>

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:47.980
<i>How I've missed you...</i>

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.850
<i>I missed you so much, I feel like
my heart is being torn apart...</i>

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.820
<i>Regardless of how you treated me,
you're still my only sister...</i>

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.420
<i>Mom is dead...</i>

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:57.510
<i>Mom is...</i>

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:01.220
<i>Even so, what is Rosalie doing here?</i>

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:02.790
<i>I don't understand it at all.</i>

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:07.060
<i>She looked so beautiful and her clothes
were much finer than mine.</i>

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.330
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.630
<i>I don't understand at all...</i>

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:25.940
Rosalie, you carried yourself very
well at Madame Elizabeth's ball.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:27.740
Do you really think so?

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.640
But I...

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:33.320
If you didn't say you were the daughter
of noble outright like you did,

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.330
everyone around you would have probably
realized you were from the slums.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:38.060
Yes.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.650
If they had figured you out,

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:44.760
you'd have lost the opportunity to
find your mother's killer forever.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:46.430
Yes.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.270
<i>Lady Oscar...</i>

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.300
<i>Please don't stare at me like that.</i>

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:56.630
<i>It feels as though a mirror has shattered to pieces,
and the shards are piercing me like a knife.</i>

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.590
Are you cold, Rosalie?

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:00.800
N-No.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.490
Your hands are trembling.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:03.490
You may go.

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:04.750
I'll do the rest myself.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:05.190
Yes.

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:06.860
Please prepare my military uniform.

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:09.270
I have to report for duty at the palace tonight.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.870
Oscar, I know you were worried
about my gambling habits,

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.400
but I've stopped now, so please don't worry.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:19.600
Yes.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.330
I'm happy to hear this from the bottom
of my heart, Your Majesty.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:24.410
<i>Oscar...</i>

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:27.880
<i>I'm sure you would have liked to ensnare
me with the gambling incident, but...</i>

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:28.840
<i>Well, too bad.</i>

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.780
By the way, Oscar,

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:34.450
I hear you have a very charming
lady staying at your manor.

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:36.290
It's quite the gossip.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.840
With all due respect,
she is a distant relative of mine.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:41.090
I see!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.830
Please have her accompany
you to court next time!

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:47.300
My, a Queen mustn't concern
herself with such a girl.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:54.740
Besides, during my absence at the ball
the other day due to a cold,

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:59.240
I was told that girl was terribly
rude to my daughter.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.200
Rude?

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.160
I hear she threw a fan at my daughter.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:06.620
Lady Charlotte was the one
at fault, Madame Polignac.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:11.290
My, how dare you suggest such a thing!
My daughter is the one at fault?!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.420
Indeed.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:15.720
Your daughter insulted Rosalie first,

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:19.250
so please have Lady Charlotte apologize,
next time they meet.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.710
H-How dare you...

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.730
<i>...speak to me like that!</i>

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.030
<i>Oscar is dangerous!</i>

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:27.840
<i>Let alone the gambling incident.</i>

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.140
<i>I had assumed she was just a mere guard.</i>

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.310
<i>If I don't get rid of her soon,</i>

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.640
<i>I have a feeling she might ruin me.</i>

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.680
<i>I'm in a position where I can do anything right now.</i>

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:38.880
<i>Anything...!</i>

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.740
<i>I won't hesitate to use that power!</i>

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.220
Concentrate more!

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:53.790
Lunge at me!

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:55.700
What's wrong, Rosalie?

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:58.500
Can't concentrate unless you're training with Oscar?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:04.180
You'll never be able to avenge
your mother at this rate.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:05.630
Avenge my mother...!

